# r1106spf boot 1, new SQ-SPF rows (gen.sh puts this after the boot-only reruns and the probes).
pace 1

## SQ-SPF-00 | boot on the 18:5x builds: jars, mixin and class errors, script errors
> pbot spawn qa -20 -60 -24 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException).*(com\.SaintAlfonzo|ce\.shared)
kjsreject Error occurred while handling event
kjsreject ReferenceError
kjsreject global\.(CEN|CMG|CEQ|CWG|CDV) (missing|is undefined)
shell ls mods | grep -iE "^creative|exposure" ; grep -ciE "Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException" logs/latest.log; grep -hE "Error occurred while handling event|ReferenceError" logs/kubejs/*.log | head
look 11 Creative jars (Common, Compat, Calendar, Devtools, Magic, Equipment, Engineering, Worldgen, Delight, Brewing, Labels) plus Exposure; tag/registry/recipe diff is done offline by compare.py

## SQ-SPF-03 | Common: advancements dropped, farmer trades
